        "data": {
          "title": "Start",
          "content": "You glance down at the pregnancy test you just bought from the dollar store.\n\nYou may think that you need to spend more than that to ensure reliability when it comes to such a consequential matter, but...as it turns out, you've come to find that they are every bit as accurate as the ones that cost upwards of $20 at other stores.\n\nYou just dipped the absorbent tip into the cup you urinated into less than a minute ago, replacing the plastic cover and setting it down on the edge of the bathtub.\n\nOne line means not pregnant.\n\nTwo lines means your fears are confirmed.\n\nIt's still too soon for any of them to have appeared yet.\n\nYou let out a long sigh of dread and anticipation.",
