        "data": {
          "title": "Partner in Crime",
          "content": "You roll your eyes after reading the text from Marcus. He's your on-and-off again partner in crime, so to speak.\n\nThe relationship is quite volatile and unhealthy, but not explicitly violent or dangerous.\n\nYou know he's asking half out of a desire to show you support, and half because he would be nearly as displeased as you would to find out you're pregnant.\n\nThinking more about it now, you wonder why the hell he is even acting like it's that big of a deal to him.\n\nHow sure are you that he caused it, if the result is positive?",
          "blockType": "narrative",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "0330aeb3-55a1-4882-b0ea-fc625b7f2547",
              "label": "He is the only person I have had sex with",
